{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05158","headline":"奉荅燕公 · 赵冬曦","name":"奉荅燕公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁道零陵守，东过此地游。\n友僚同省阁，昆弟接荆州。\n我逐江潭鴈，君随海上鸥。\n屡伤神气阻，久别鬓毛秋。\n疑岭春应徧，阳台雨欲收。\n主人情未尽，高驾少淹留。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵冬曦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05158.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05158","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}